fs-uilleann-pipe.sf2 (pipe drone)
  "FS Uilleann Pipe" by Mr Fuzzywump, made from a sample by luis_audp on Freesound.
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0: http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
  Source: https://musical-artifacts.com/artifacts/3062
  The site puts a Cloudflare challenge on file downloads. Download the file in a browser and save it here with this name.
  A piece that uses the drone puts this credit in the comment tag of its MP3.

